## Observation

Status
Retired

Historical
Yes

Reason
Originally intended to describe directly perceived battle facts. The term accumulated multiple unrelated meanings (Battle runtime, OCR, UI, Overlays, etc.) until it no longer communicated architectural ownership.

Policy
Observation is Retired. It shall not appear in the names of:
- packages
- source files
- classes
- interfaces
- composables
- architectural layers
- primary runtime concepts

Existing usages are retained as **historical artifacts** until individually retired through dedicated vocabulary bricks. Retired terms shall not be reactivated.

